BreastGPT — Anonymous-Review License Notice
=============================================

This repository is shared in support of a peer-reviewed scientific
submission and is currently in an anonymous review state.

During anonymous review:

  - The materials in this repository are made available for non-commercial,
    review-only inspection by the program committee and reviewers of the
    submitting venue.

  - No additional rights are granted, by implication or otherwise. The
    code, model weights (if and when released), dataset references, and
    documentation may not be redistributed, reused in derivative works,
    deployed in production systems, or used to train commercial models
    without explicit written permission.

  - No clinical use is permitted. See the medical disclaimer below.

  - No attempt should be made to de-anonymize the authors via repository
    metadata, commit history, or related artefacts.

Final licensing terms — covering the code, model checkpoints, and any
released portions of the BreastStage dataset — will be specified at the
time of de-anonymization, after governance, privacy, and institutional
review have completed.

Medical disclaimer
------------------

BreastGPT is a research system. It is not a medical device. It is not
intended for clinical deployment or for independent medical
decision-making. Any clinical application would require prospective
validation, regulatory review, and supervision by qualified medical
professionals.

— BreastGPT authors (anonymous)
